# ⚠️ RULES — READ BEFORE EDITING:
#
# 1. DO NOT add apex↔www redirects here (e.g. pcplaza-15.com → www.pcplaza-15.com).
#    Netlify's dashboard "primary domain" setting (Site configuration → Domains)
#    already redirects every attached domain (apex, www, aliases) to the primary
#    domain automatically. Duplicating it here causes an ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS
#    loop (this actually happened and required Netlify support to fix).
#
# 2. DO NOT copy redirect rules from other projects/templates. Every host listed
#    here must be a hostname that was genuinely attached to THIS site. Rules for
#    hosts that never reach this site are dead config and hide contamination.
#
# 3. File-based redirects are ONLY for things the dashboard cannot do:
#    path renames (below) and, if ever needed, genuinely different legacy
#    hostnames that are NOT attached as Netlify domain aliases.
#
# ============================================================================
